		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Tainted mortals that transform into insectoids. Hybrid of giant wasp and elf.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 12, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 stinger +3 (1d6 + venom), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Entothropy</strong>. If 12 or more damage from the same werewasp, contract entothropy.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magic sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Venom</strong>. CON 12+ or go to 0 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
